/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040non\055commutative\040framework\040for\040topological\040insulators)
/Author (Chris\040Bourne\054\040Chris\040Bourne\054\040Chris\040Bourne\054\040Alan\040L\056\040Carey\054\040Alan\040L\056\040Carey\054\040Adam\040Rennie)
/Subject (We\040study\040topological\040insulators\054\040regarded\040as\040physical\040systems\040giving\040rise\040to\040topological\040invariants\040determined\040by\040symmetries\040both\040linear\040and\040anti\055linear\056\040Our\040perspective\040is\040that\040of\040non\055commutative\040index\040theory\040of\040operator\040algebras\056\040In\040particular\054\040we\040formulate\040the\040index\040problems\040using\040Kasparov\040theory\054\040both\040complex\040and\040real\056\040We\040show\040that\040the\040periodic\040table\040of\040topological\040insulators\040and\040superconductors\040can\040be\040realized\040as\040a\040real\040or\040complex\040index\040pairing\040of\040a\040Kasparov\040module\040capturing\040internal\040symmetries\040of\040the\040Hamiltonian\040with\040a\040spectral\040triple\040encoding\040the\040geometry\040of\040the\040sample\220s\040\050possibly\040non\055commutative\051\040Brillouin\040zone\056)
/Keywords (11\040Apr\0402016\054\040Reviews\040in\040Mathematical\040Physics\054\040Operator\040algebra\054\040Topological\040insulator\054\040KK\055theory\054\040Commutative\040property\054\040Spectral\040triple\054\040Australian\040National\040University\054\040University\040of\040Erlangen\055Nuremberg\054\040University\040of\040Wollongong)
>>
endobj
